  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Soil 403.01 Initiation of Disciplinary Action. The board shall undertake misconduct investigations, settlements of misconduct allegations, or disciplinary hearings, in response to any information which reasonably suggests that a certificate holder has engaged in professional misconduct.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Soil 400) #9886-A, eff 3-11-11, EXPIRED: 3-11-19\n\nNew. #13560, eff 4-7-23 (formerly Soil 402.01)",
